# The Nebula resource pack. Only the 23 block textures the engine actually loads are committed
# (86 KB of a 14.6 MB, 2096-file pack) along with pack.mcmeta and the readme carrying its licence
# terms -- see ATTRIBUTION.md. Those files are already tracked, so this rule does not affect them;
# it keeps the ~1800 unused textures from showing up as untracked noise.
#
# ⚠️ Adding a new block texture therefore needs `git add -f <path>`, or it will be silently
# ignored. Keep the full pack in place locally: expanding the palette is then just a copy.
/resource_pack/

# Keep the unpacked upstream archive out of history (46 MB).
/Nebula*.zip
